<p>Each time you take damage, you roll <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 36%, 45%, 53%, 60%</acronym> of your mental save against it.  A successful saving throw can crit and will reduce the damage by at least 50%.</p><p>The first talent point invested will also increase the amount of Psi you gain from Willpower by 0.5, but reduce the amount of life you gain from Constitution by 0.25.</p><p>The first talent point also increases your solipsism threshold by 10% (currently 0%).</p>